1
00:01:08,550 --> 00:01:12,900
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,010 --> 00:01:16,030
[Episode 16]

3
00:01:16,950 --> 00:01:17,950
Have you arrived?

4
00:01:19,870 --> 00:01:21,400
Solve the issue thoroughly.

5
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:23,530
Don't cause trouble for your brother.

6
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,900
You want money, right?

7
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,060
Is this enough?

8
00:01:39,070 --> 00:01:40,130
Don't come near me.

9
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:41,140
Not enough?

10
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,680
Still not enough?

11
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,039
Name a price.

12
00:01:48,759 --> 00:01:50,890
I'll give you as much money as you want.

13
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:51,840
Go away!

14
00:01:52,950 --> 00:01:53,640
Miss,

15
00:01:54,350 --> 00:01:55,410
put down the knife.

16
00:01:56,310 --> 00:01:57,289
Don't be afraid.

17
00:01:57,479 --> 00:01:58,610
I'm here to help you.

18
00:01:59,789 --> 00:02:00,590
Put it down.

19
00:02:01,570 --> 00:02:03,570
Just put down the knife first, okay?

20
00:02:04,390 --> 00:02:05,840
We shouldn't punish ourselves

21
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,500
for other people's mistakes.

22
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:08,870
Okay?

23
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,660
Think about it.

24
00:02:12,030 --> 00:02:14,690
Around you, there are still people
who love you.

25
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:16,960
Put down the knife.

26
00:02:23,870 --> 00:02:24,730
My dear child,

27
00:02:24,890 --> 00:02:26,200
I know everything.

28
00:02:26,630 --> 00:02:27,960
But it's not your fault.

29
00:02:28,829 --> 00:02:30,550
I will always be with you.

30
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:31,700
Come on.

31
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,360
Come down.

32
00:02:53,100 --> 00:02:54,900
Come on. I'll take you two out.

33
00:02:55,870 --> 00:02:56,400
Let's go.

34
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,329
Let's go.

35
00:03:01,430 --> 00:03:01,960
Wait.

36
00:03:03,750 --> 00:03:05,210
Where are you taking them?

37
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:07,640
Dr. Fang, thanks for your help.

38
00:03:11,150 --> 00:03:13,240
Don't leave any records.

39
00:03:20,030 --> 00:03:20,800
Come with me.

40
00:03:38,340 --> 00:03:39,960
Did Zhao Xiao ask you to come here?

41
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,090
I'm here to help you.

42
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,060
You're here to help me?

43
00:03:44,150 --> 00:03:45,550
Do you think I'm an idiot?

44
00:03:49,710 --> 00:03:52,570
Do you want to
keep cleaning up your brother's mess?

45
00:03:53,210 --> 00:03:55,160
I don't understand
what you're talking about.

46
00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:57,120
Regarding the things you did
at the Spotlight Bar

47
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,400
and that girl just now,

48
00:03:59,030 --> 00:04:01,630
aren't you just trying to gather resources
for your brother?

49
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:02,690
What a crazy woman.

50
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:04,370
You are brothers.

51
00:04:05,590 --> 00:04:08,020
Why does your mother treat you two

52
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,330
so differently?

53
00:04:11,890 --> 00:04:13,290
What's more, I also heard

54
00:04:14,710 --> 00:04:16,390
that one of you two

55
00:04:16,390 --> 00:04:18,720
didn't originally have the surname Zhao.

56
00:04:19,850 --> 00:04:21,779
What exactly are you trying to say?

57
00:04:22,430 --> 00:04:24,760
Are you not your mother's biological son?

58
00:04:26,430 --> 00:04:27,720
So,

59
00:04:27,850 --> 00:04:29,560
in the eyes of that mother and her son,

60
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:32,190
you are just a minion at their disposal.

61
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,200
You...

62
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:40,070
Do you think I wouldn't dare to touch you?

63
00:04:40,750 --> 00:04:42,000
What's the rush?

64
00:04:42,750 --> 00:04:44,210
Have you ever thought that

65
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:47,840
if the Spotlight Bar's scandal
is exposed one day,

66
00:04:49,190 --> 00:04:50,520
who will take the blame?

67
00:04:52,750 --> 00:04:54,830
You also know what happened to Lin Di'er.

68
00:04:54,830 --> 00:04:56,390
If you keep working for them,

69
00:04:56,390 --> 00:04:57,810
you should know very well

70
00:04:58,830 --> 00:05:00,630
what the outcome will be, right?

71
00:05:00,730 --> 00:05:02,250
I'm happy with it.

72
00:05:02,830 --> 00:05:04,480
Your own mother
refuses to acknowledge you

73
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:06,610
and treats someone else as her own son.

74
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,530
Are you happy with that too?

75
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,510
I found this in a photo studio

76
00:05:23,510 --> 00:05:25,000
in Chen Jihong's hometown.

77
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:28,130
The owner of the studio said
Chen Jihong only has one son.

78
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,360
His name is...

79
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,340
Fang.

80
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:42,130
If you want to break away from them now,

81
00:05:42,159 --> 00:05:43,490
it's still not too late.

82
00:05:43,950 --> 00:05:45,200
I can help you.

83
00:05:51,510 --> 00:05:52,710
Why would you help me?

84
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:56,280
Aren't you afraid I'll tell him?

85
00:06:05,770 --> 00:06:08,080
[Mom]

86
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,730
How will you help me?

87
00:06:14,310 --> 00:06:16,040
Mr. Li, Mr. Wang,

88
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,430
right now in the market,

89
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:20,000
it's all about romance movies.

90
00:06:20,060 --> 00:06:21,760
Now I've found a great script.

91
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:24,680
It's a romantic fantasy action movie,

92
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:26,410
and Zhao Xiao will be the male lead.

93
00:06:26,410 --> 00:06:27,920
I'd like to take this opportunity

94
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:30,510
to drink a toast to all the bosses again.

95
00:06:30,630 --> 00:06:31,510
We've been drinking all night.

96
00:06:31,510 --> 00:06:32,970
Haven't you drunk enough?

97
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,950
Zhao Xiao hasn't drunk all night.

98
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:41,700
Come here.

99
00:06:46,190 --> 00:06:46,720
Come on.

100
00:06:47,310 --> 00:06:49,980
This is Zhao Xiao's younger brother,
Zhao Fang.

101
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:52,510
Since you gentlemen
haven't drunk enough today,

102
00:06:52,510 --> 00:06:54,740
I'll ask Zhao Fang to drink with you.

103
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:55,870
Ms. Chen.

104
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:58,120
You're taking too good care of Zhao Xiao.

105
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,720
Mr. Wang, you must be joking.

106
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:02,160
Zhao Xiao has undergone major surgery.

107
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,790
If he drinks too much,

108
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:05,760
his body won't be able to take it.

109
00:07:06,750 --> 00:07:08,750
I'm sorry for being late, everyone.

110
00:07:09,070 --> 00:07:11,330
I'll drink a glass of this as punishment.

111
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:14,020
He can really hold his liquor.

112
00:07:22,100 --> 00:07:24,830
To drink a toast,
the glass must be refilled thoroughly.

113
00:07:24,830 --> 00:07:25,720
Do as Mr. Pei said.

114
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:26,980
Refill it thoroughly.

115
00:07:27,430 --> 00:07:28,240
Okay.

116
00:07:29,810 --> 00:07:30,320
Mr. Pei.

117
00:07:32,070 --> 00:07:33,070
I'll drink it all.

118
00:07:58,260 --> 00:08:00,620
Stop hitting him! Stop it!

119
00:08:01,270 --> 00:08:02,240
Run! Run!

120
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,630
Stop hitting him!

121
00:08:03,780 --> 00:08:05,420
Whose kids are you?

122
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:16,190
Are you okay, Xiao?

123
00:08:18,190 --> 00:08:18,750
Don't cry.

124
00:08:18,750 --> 00:08:19,720
Good child.

125
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:49,680
They all bullied me.

126
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:51,700
Why didn't you comfort me?

127
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:54,580
You're not a child
of the Zhao family anyway.

128
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:55,790
So,

129
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:58,360
everything must
revolve around your brother.

130
00:08:58,360 --> 00:09:00,440
Whatever your brother tells you to do,

131
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,840
you should listen to him.

132
00:09:09,590 --> 00:09:11,300
I've long heard

133
00:09:11,670 --> 00:09:13,850
that Ms. Chen has two capable sons.

134
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:15,960
I've never had the chance to see

135
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:18,720
what exactly
her younger son is capable of.

136
00:09:19,030 --> 00:09:21,250
Today, I finally got to see it.

137
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,200
To tell you the truth,

138
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:25,410
let me disclose this to you all.

139
00:09:25,410 --> 00:09:28,420
I'm going to
make a bigger romantic fantasy movie.

140
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:30,790
I also want to make a contribution

141
00:09:30,790 --> 00:09:32,450
to the Chinese film industry.

142
00:09:33,030 --> 00:09:33,600
Bro!

143
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,450
Where are you going?

144
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:36,910
Bro, you guys can keep talking.

145
00:09:36,910 --> 00:09:38,000
I'm not feeling well.

146
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,360
I'm going to the restroom.

147
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,710
Keep drinking.

148
00:09:41,790 --> 00:09:43,380
Come on. Let's continue.

149
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:45,250
Then thank you, Mr. Pei.

150
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:45,750
Come on!

151
00:09:45,750 --> 00:09:46,720
Mr. Wang, Mr. Li!

152
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:49,600
The male lead has to be Zhao Xiao.

153
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,150
You both have seen

154
00:09:51,170 --> 00:09:52,930
his market appeal.

155
00:09:52,570 --> 00:09:54,780
[Ms. Qin]

156
00:09:53,890 --> 00:09:54,740
Thank you.

157
00:10:06,150 --> 00:10:07,130
The bar's affairs

158
00:10:07,130 --> 00:10:09,390
have always been managed
by my brother, Zhao Fang.

159
00:10:09,390 --> 00:10:10,750
I really have no idea what shady business

160
00:10:10,750 --> 00:10:11,600
he's doing exactly.

161
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:12,930
Don't you know whose man

162
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:13,770
Cui Peng is?

163
00:10:13,870 --> 00:10:15,130
As a matrilocal husband,

164
00:10:15,130 --> 00:10:16,980
he got all his resources from me.

165
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,960
I negotiated every single project for him.

166
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,290
You found women for him.

167
00:10:20,550 --> 00:10:22,910
How dare you run your business
at the cost of my interests?

168
00:10:22,910 --> 00:10:23,870
With just a flick of my finger,

169
00:10:23,870 --> 00:10:26,130
I can make sure you'll be ruined forever.

170
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:26,910
Ms. Qin,

171
00:10:27,270 --> 00:10:29,070
I really didn't know about this.

172
00:10:29,630 --> 00:10:30,840
Please calm down.

173
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:32,320
Shut up.

174
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,260
Then tell me what to do.

175
00:10:36,390 --> 00:10:37,650
I'll just do as you say.

176
00:10:37,910 --> 00:10:39,150
I wasn't involved
in the Spotlight Bar's business

177
00:10:39,150 --> 00:10:40,480
from beginning to end.

178
00:10:41,030 --> 00:10:42,750
Now that it has caused you
so much trouble,

179
00:10:42,750 --> 00:10:45,080
I'm apologizing to you
on behalf of my brother.

180
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:45,880
Apologizing?

181
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:48,000
Don't think that by bowing
and saying sorry here,

182
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,530
this matter can be settled.

183
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,720
Zhao Fang, right?

184
00:10:50,910 --> 00:10:52,150
Tell him to stay away.

185
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:55,320
You still don't understand?

186
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:57,210
As long as he stays in this industry,

187
00:10:57,210 --> 00:10:59,600
sooner or later, I'll deal with you too.

188
00:11:01,670 --> 00:11:03,530
Zhao Fang is my brother after all.

189
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:05,320
Please show mercy

190
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,180
and let him off.

191
00:11:06,250 --> 00:11:08,360
Fine. Since you love your brother so much,

192
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:10,950
then you can bear the blame for him.

193
00:11:12,970 --> 00:11:14,430
I will handle this matter.

194
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:18,640
If I confine him somewhere,
do you think that's...
